{"id":"633376","name":"月亮粑","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/633376/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"大米","amount":"200克"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"水","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"白芝麻","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"油","amount":"稍宽"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"五香粉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好大米，清洗干净。","img":"images/633376/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"提前泡发一个晚上。","img":"images/633376/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入料理机中，加刚刚沫过大米的凉水。","img":"images/633376/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"打成细腻的米浆。","img":"images/633376/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"稀米浆就好了。","img":"images/633376/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入适量的面粉，搅拌均匀，一定不能太稠哦，太稠了，炸好的成品发硬不脆。","img":"images/633376/step_6.jpeg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加盐、白芝麻和五香粉。","img":"images/633376/step_7.jpeg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入葱花，搅拌均匀。","img":"images/633376/step_8.jpeg"},{"step":9,"desc":"起锅烧油，模具一并放入油锅中加热。","img":"images/633376/step_9.jpeg"},{"step":10,"desc":"油五成热时，勺入半勺面糊水摊开在模具中。","img":"images/633376/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放入油锅。","img":"images/633376/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"炸一两分钟会自动浮起，依次全部做完。","img":"images/633376/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"翻面，炸至两面金黄即可出锅。","img":"images/633376/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"沥干油。","img":"images/633376/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/633376/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品图，咸香酥脆，老少皆宜。","img":"images/633376/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}